  "descriptionHtml": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Introducing the all-new Abound SR—the enhanced cargo ebike built to carry anything and tackle every challenge. Whether you're cruising through the streets or bike pooling with a friend, the Abound SR is always ready for any action. Its compact frame keeps you agile, while advanced security<sup>†</sup> and GPS<sup>†</sup> features give you total peace of mind.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"> </p>\n<p>Outfitted with an adjustable quill stem, suspension seatpost, and cutting-edge theft deterrent features<sup>†</sup>, every ride is smooth, secure, and stress-free. Whether it’s a quick trip or a big haul, the Abound SR is your go-to for dominating the road.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>It’s <strong>SR</strong>sly fun.</p><h2>Buying your Aventon from Quest Watersports</h2><ul><li>Every e-bike purchased through Quest Watersports includes a <strong>$160 assembly and tuning fee</strong>.</li><li>Colors and sizes we don't have in stock can be special ordered. Call 815.433.2200 or request info below.</li><li>Financing is available through Synchrony, subject to credit approval.</li></ul>",
